{"steam_appid":2873060,"steam_name":"The Bell Echoes","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2873060/845698368/58fed55abee6f31b344c6766e2910f7357918252/1790514795/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1790515852","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257437260/92c5629df4d558fffd2359f8eece226bd1c52326/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1790515852","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/7eeaf948176eabbb00ffa750e6256a5dbb319abb/ss_7eeaf948176eabbb00ffa750e6256a5dbb319abb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790560807","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/ee508154e3f6475e53f667271987b4277cb27c66/ss_ee508154e3f6475e53f667271987b4277cb27c66.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790560807","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/63b413c1b27b12dcf6a55d20e84d1ba421e0541c/ss_63b413c1b27b12dcf6a55d20e84d1ba421e0541c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790560807","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/6dd4db668f6426372d5c95623bd2ba3e9290f25b/ss_6dd4db668f6426372d5c95623bd2ba3e9290f25b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790560807","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/51537c3788c6737f63c2b9c4a1383523c8fbd3c7/ss_51537c3788c6737f63c2b9c4a1383523c8fbd3c7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790560807"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>· Fight alongside your companions and venture deeper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you will meet a cast of distinctive companions and venture deeper together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New regions will open, new allies will join your party, and new storylines will unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every step forward, you draw closer to their pasts—and to the hidden side of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/4ad9ad8ef27c3b1349508df1b37a33f1.poster.avif?t=1790560807\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/4ad9ad8ef27c3b1349508df1b37a33f1.webm?t=1790560807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/4ad9ad8ef27c3b1349508df1b37a33f1.mp4?t=1790560807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>· Not your usual “move once, attack once” tactics game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a rich and versatile skill set, letting you freely plan an entire turn around your resources and chain multiple abilities together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your three party members link their actions together, a single battle becomes a layered, coordinated offensive of your own making. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2214b8862e8f760d1c099868a016d9e8.poster.avif?t=1790560807\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2214b8862e8f760d1c099868a016d9e8.webm?t=1790560807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2214b8862e8f760d1c099868a016d9e8.mp4?t=1790560807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>· Knockbacks, collisions, terrain, and objects are all weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height, cover, displacement, knockbacks, collisions, and battlefield objects and terrain all have a real impact on combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slam enemies into obstacles, trigger chain reactions through objects, and use terrain to reshape both offense and defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a seemingly limited battlefield can keep opening up new tactical solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/80159055f846a0cf8557161ae1de9ae7.poster.avif?t=1790560807\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/80159055f846a0cf8557161ae1de9ae7.webm?t=1790560807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/80159055f846a0cf8557161ae1de9ae7.mp4?t=1790560807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>· Repeated ventures shape each character’s combat style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you push deeper, your characters continue to grow in new directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Insights can change how abilities function, while talents, equipment, gems, and other upgrades can push the same character toward completely different builds and playstyles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2b394ddc77db81e8da53e08349fc290c.poster.avif?t=1790560807\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2b394ddc77db81e8da53e08349fc290c.webm?t=1790560807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/2b394ddc77db81e8da53e08349fc290c.mp4?t=1790560807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/10c111d2da9412d7c3f2833624b84b89.poster.avif?t=1790560807\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/10c111d2da9412d7c3f2833624b84b89.webm?t=1790560807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/10c111d2da9412d7c3f2833624b84b89.mp4?t=1790560807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>· Echoes open the path, memories reveal the truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat powerful enemies and obtain precious Echoes to advance the story and unlock deeper regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep venturing deeper and collect Chapter Memory Fragments to uncover each character’s hidden past—and the deeper secrets of the world itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/35c849c4dc3a8e9b918d860c051eb750.poster.avif?t=1790560807\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/35c849c4dc3a8e9b918d860c051eb750.webm?t=1790560807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/35c849c4dc3a8e9b918d860c051eb750.mp4?t=1790560807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/edbe60d212b0270b5a696f80bdd6e7b5.poster.avif?t=1790560807\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/edbe60d212b0270b5a696f80bdd6e7b5.webm?t=1790560807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873060/extras/edbe60d212b0270b5a696f80bdd6e7b5.mp4?t=1790560807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact Us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please leave us a message in the Steam discussion group, or send us an email at <a href=\"mailto:382330596@qq.com\">382330596@qq.com</a>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> 100% DirectX 9.0c compatible sound card</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> 100% DirectX 9.0c compatible sound card</li></ul>","genres":["RPG","Strategy"],"developers":["七颗枚"],"publishers":["七颗枚","WeKnowGame"],"release_date":"Sep 27, 2026"}